  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nDepends on: #530.\n\n`edm.conditions[]` in the `.mch`: `{ id, name, gap_mm, wire_diameter_mm | undersize_mm, role: rough|skim|finish, notes }`. No vendor values are shipped (D4). Add a lookup API for ops, plus refusal at command creation when an op names a condition the machine does not state, or a condition lacks a field the op needs.\n\n**Done means:** an op referencing a missing or incomplete condition is refused at command creation, naming the machine and condition. A filled synthetic table resolves the gap and wire diameter. Pinned by app tests.",
